        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on menu, recipes, and food safety steps for the pilot.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 157604,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've uploaded the first draft of the 2-week rotating menu for the new service. Please take a look at A1. It covers the basics for T1 and T2, but I'd appreciate feedback, especially on the dietary notes.",
            "mentions": [
              520047,
              92532,
              95695,
              518039
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 520047,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks. Looking at A1, the variety is good. For the low-salt meals, are we using specific salt substitutes or just reducing sodium in the base ingredients? We need to be precise in the recipes for T2 to ensure consistency and safety.",
            "mentions": [
              157604
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 92532,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "What if a client doesn't want the meal of the day? Can they ask for something else?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 157604,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point. For now, it's just reduction in base ingredients. I'll add a note in the recipes to specify 'no added salt' and list the sodium content where possible. I'll update A1.",
            "mentions": [
              520047
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 157604,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "For the pilot, the menu is fixed to test the process. We'll log feedback about preferences, but substitutions aren't planned for now. That's a good point for the aides to be aware of when talking to clients.",
            "mentions": [
              92532
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 95695,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "The menu looks solid. One thought on A1: for dishes like the baked fish and chicken stew, we should specify a 'soft food' preparation alternative in the recipe notes. Some clients may have difficulty with chewing, and this would be a simple modification for the kitchen to handle.",
            "mentions": [
              157604
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 157604,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Excellent idea, I hadn't considered that explicitly. I'll add a 'soft prep' option for 3-4 of the main dishes. I've updated A1 with all the feedback now. If there are no other comments, I think we can approve the menu.",
            "mentions": [
              95695
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 518039,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "The menu in A1 looks good to me now. Let's lock it in.",
