            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 95695,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "To help with the time constraint mentioned by @92532, we could simplify the 'Client Status' section in A2. Instead of text boxes for mood and hydration, we could use a simple 3-point scale with icons (e.g., smiley face, neutral, sad face). It's faster and still captures the trend.",
            "mentions": [
