            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "The incident flow in A3 needs a clearer distinction between 'urgent' and 'non-urgent'. I suggest we add a rule: 'If there is immediate risk to client health or safety, call the office supervisor immediately. For all other issues, note it on the checklist and report at end of day'. This removes ambiguity.",
